# Pairs with ParentSiblingConsistency. The child route precedes its persistent child-side reference.
MODULE: ChainSuccessorPublishesEarly
TARGET: ParentSiblingConsistency
CLASS: Invariant
SUMMARY: parent routing is published without the child-side reference
PERTURBS: ChainSuccessor

--- FIND
ChainSuccessor ==
    /\ phase = "splitting"
    /\ donorNext
    /\ ~successorPrev
    /\ successorPrev' = TRUE
    /\ linked' = FALSE
--- REPLACE
\* MUTATION: publish the route before the child-side reference.
ChainSuccessor ==
    /\ phase = "splitting"
    /\ donorNext
    /\ ~successorPrev
    /\ successorPrev' = TRUE
    /\ linked' = TRUE
--- END
